 the service failed health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an 18% error rate. v2.3.1 (and its staging candidate v2.3.1-rc) were marked unhealthy. checkout-api was rolled back in all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. Next steps: confirm the service is healthy on v2.3.0 and find the root cause in v2.3.1 before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 120989, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01FEQFSatvmjngBQjadWVAYU", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 120989, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01FEQFSatvmjngBQjadWVAYU", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 122667, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01WWppgcnwLxZWp3iHkeM4hf", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 122967, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01WWppgcnwLxZWp3iHkeM4hf", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 122967, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01WWppgcnwLxZWp3iHkeM4hf", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 127431, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_011DTyr3d74vefWsTbUZLC3G", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the latest deploy of checkout-api v2.3.1, the service failed health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an 18% error rate. v2.3.1 (and its staging candidate v2.3.1-rc) were marked unhealthy. checkout-api was rolled back in all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. After the rollback the service is healthy in all regions with a 0.2% error rate. Next steps: find the root cause in v2.3.1 before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 128031, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_011DTyr3d74vefWsTbUZLC3G", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 128031, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011DTyr3d74vefWsTbUZLC3G", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 133150, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n1. **What was wrong:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate. Its staging build, v2.3.1-rc, had also been marked unhealthy.\n2. **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. I rolled back to it in all three regions, and a human approver signed off on the rollback.\n3. **Check after rollback:** All three regions are on v2.3.0 and healthy, with the error rate down to 0.2%.\n4. **Incident:** The first attempt to open the SEV2 timed out. The incident list showed nothing had been created, so I tried again with the same request ID, which guards against a duplicate. That created INC-0001 for checkout-api and paged on-call. The summary covers the failure, the rollback, the recovery, and the next step: find what broke in v2.3.1 before deploying it again.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01JUEPgFu2dNtdK3NAmFWkXq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_017L1NvaxX2fsj1jScMpoEUK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01TzpoHTFHEphaXrvzaeNa3m", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Ki2giTbAnACKjWVjQ8abYt", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01FEQFSatvmjngBQjadWVAYU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the latest deploy of checkout-api v2.3.1, the service failed health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an 18% error rate. v2.3.1 (and its staging candidate v2.3.1-rc) were marked unhealthy. checkout-api was rolled back in all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. Next steps: confirm the service is healthy on v2.3.0 and find the root cause in v2.3.1 before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01WWppgcnwLxZWp3iHkeM4hf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_011DTyr3d74vefWsTbUZLC3G", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the latest deploy of checkout-api v2.3.1, the service failed health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an 18% error rate. v2.3.1 (and its staging candidate v2.3.1-rc) were marked unhealthy. checkout-api was rolled back in all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. After the rollback the service is healthy in all regions with a 0.2% error rate. Next steps: find the root cause in v2.3.1 before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n1. **What was wrong:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate. Its staging build, v2.3.1-rc, had also been marked unhealthy.\n2. **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. I rolled back to it in all three regions, and a human approver signed off on the rollback.\n3. **Check after rollback:** All three regions are on v2.3.0 and healthy, with the error rate down to 0.2%.\n4. **Incident:** The first attempt to open the SEV2 timed out. The incident list showed nothing had been created, so I tried again with the same request ID, which guards against a duplicate. That created INC-0001 for checkout-api and paged on-call. The summary covers the failure, the rollback, the recovery, and the next step: find what broke in v2.3.1 before deploying it again.", "type": "text"}]}]}